    "MiraNote will look through your recent photos on this iPhone. For each moment it considers, it sends up to 10 photos, with when and roughly where they were taken and what is in them, to our server and an AI service that writes the reminder. This is a test feature." : {
      "comment" : "Settings: confirmation body before the photo trigger is turned on; what is uploaded and where.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MiraNote 会查看这台 iPhone 上最近的照片。每考虑一段回忆，就会把最多 10 张照片，连同拍摄时间、大致地点和照片内容，发送到我们的服务器和一个 AI 服务，用来生成回忆提醒。这是测试中的功能。"
          }
        }
      }
